Output assets/success_demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 800
Set Height 400
Set TypingSpeed 100ms

Type "cd ~/Developer/Experiments/rust-but-lisp"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "cat examples/test.lisp"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "cargo run -- build examples/test.lisp"
Enter
Sleep 6s
